  "details": "As soon as i try on a larger graph project add in multiple toggelable event options i run in to a fairly random limitation, with the Assembly/compiler failing.  On the image provided i got a picture of the Error and a example showing the 2 connections i managed to make before the error occured. I managed to get around the issue the first time by re-factoring it into a local event that execute the last bransh. But I ran into the same issue again later with a different graph and despite using events the issue/error occured. And this error occurs even if all you do is connect a event to a empty branch with nothing else. It is as if there is a limit to how many events can be used, yet as far as i can prove it that is not the case.",
